    "Erasing also removes your data from iCloud. If you're not signed in, the next online sync will clear it on Apple's servers." : {
      "comment" : "",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Erasing also removes your data from iCloud. If you're not signed in, the next online sync will clear it on Apple's servers."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此操作会同时从 iCloud 删除你的数据。如果当前未登录 iCloud，下次联网同步时数据会从 Apple 服务器上清除。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
