    "AI 分析只会发送汇总数据（总收支、分类占比），不会上传逐笔交易明细。密钥仅保存在本机钥匙串。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AI analysis sends aggregate figures only (total income and spending, category shares) and never uploads individual transactions. The API key is stored in the local Keychain."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
